  * pgp2vcard: EID_RE also recognizes the vCard-property uid form 'UID:urn:eid:u4:VALUE' (kept: classic 'u4=VALUE' comment token) — groundwork for the vCard-shaped uids experiment
  * pgp2vcard: standard glued eid form — emit UID:urn:eid:u4VALUE (no separator, escape-proof by construction) and read it back (':?' keeps tolerating the deprecated urn:eid:u4:VALUE and u4= comment forms)

